  "description": "The \u0027dss_agenttools_live\u0027 dataset provides detailed information about various agent tools used within Dataiku DSS projects. It includes metadata about each tool, such as its unique identifier, name, type, and a description tailored for large language models (LLMs). This dataset is particularly useful for managing and analyzing the tools used in data science workflows, allowing users to understand the capabilities and configurations of each tool. It also tracks the creation and modification details, including the user responsible and the timestamp of the last modification. Additionally, the dataset contains parameters for each tool, which are stored in a JSON format, providing insights into the tool\u0027s configuration and usage context. The dataset is valuable for administrators and data scientists who need to audit, optimize, or extend the functionality of their data science projects. By providing URLs to the tools, it facilitates easy access and management within the Dataiku platform. The inclusion of LLM identifiers and tags further enhances the dataset\u0027s utility in environments where AI and machine learning models are integrated into data processing workflows.",
